flowchart TD
Optimize["**Run NSGA2 Optimization**<br/>Creates problem and algorithm<br/>Starts minimize loop"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>attributes: n_replications n_cores base_seed<br/>method: _evaluate(X)"]
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>config: pop size sampling crossover mutation<br/>uses termination criterion"]
Termination["**Termination**<br/>by number of generations n_gen"]
ProblemEvaluate["**Problem Evaluate Flow**<br/>_evaluate batches individuals<br/>creates tasks for Pool"]
Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>parallel workers n_cores<br/>maps evaluate tasks"]
EvalInd["**evaluate single individual**<br/>inputs: capacities vector seed n_replications<br/>runs multiple replications and aggregates<br/>returns: avg_wip negative throughput"]
RunSimCaps["**run simulation with capacities**<br/>inputs: seed capacities vector<br/>constructs DelayBuffer and Machine objects<br/>runs warmup and measurement"]
RunSim["**run simulation core**<br/>generates parts samples WIP every interval<br/>computes throughput and avg WIP<br/>returns metrics dict"]
Machine["**Machine**<br/>attrs: process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>methods: run waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer**<br/>attrs: cap delay tokens store in_transit<br/>methods: put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
CollectF["**Collect Objectives**<br/>assemble out F array<br/>shape population by objectives"]
NSGA2Step["**NSGA2 Generation Step**<br/>selection crossover mutation<br/>eliminate duplicates"]
Pareto["**Pareto Front**<br/>nondominated set across objectives"]
Export["**Export Results**<br/>write history and population to CSV in results folder"]
Manager["**Production Manager**<br/>consumes CSV and Pareto front for capacity decisions"]

Optimize --> BufferProblem
Optimize --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Termination
NSGA2Algo --> ProblemEvaluate
ProblemEvaluate --> Pool
Pool --> EvalInd
EvalInd --> RunSimCaps
RunSimCaps --> RunSim
RunSim --> DelayBuffer
RunSim --> Machine
RunSim --> EvalInd
EvalInd --> Pool
Pool --> CollectF
CollectF --> NSGA2Step
NSGA2Step --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Pareto
Pareto --> Export
Export --> Manager
Manager --> Optimize